  "definition": "“Unobstructed” as applied to exhaust stacks for purposes of modeling means that",
  "effectiveDate": "2020-09-25",
  "historyNote": "#10549, eff 4-4-14; ); ss by #13105, eff 9-25-20 (formerly Env-A 101.210) (see Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-A 100)",
